174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (   While often dismissed as simple envy, fear of missing out also known as FOMO in 2026 is a structural psychological phenomenon. It is fueled by the specifically selected reality gap. The distance between our unedited lives and the perfect versions of others we see online. This gap creates a false narrative that everyone else is living a more successful or exciting life which leads to persistent feelings of inadequacy and lower life satisfaction.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
