/P 116 0 R
/T (Consequently, this neurological taxation exhausts our cognitive resources, making it increasingly difficult to engage in the high-level emotional regulation required for healthy daily functioning)
/E (Consequently, this neurological taxation exhausts our cognitive resources, making it increasingly difficult to engage in the high-level emotional regulation required for healthy daily functioning)
/Pg 23 0 R
