236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 116 0 R
/T (   The impact of this mental exhaustion extends far beyond the individual, severely degrading the quality of interpersonal communication and social cohesion. When a person is saturated with global-scale anxieties, they often experience "compassion fatigue," a state where the emotional bandwidth for empathy toward friends and family is depleted by the sheer volume of distant tragedies. This often manifests as "phubbing" or irritability in physical spaces, as the individual becomes more tethered to the urgent, digital simulation of crisis than to the nuanced, quiet reality of the people sitting directly across from them.)
/E (   The impact of this mental exhaustion extends far beyond the individual, severely degrading the quality of interpersonal communication and social cohesion. When a person is saturated with global-scale anxieties, they often experience "compassion fatigue," a state where the emotional bandwidth for empathy toward friends and family is depleted by the sheer volume of distant tragedies. This often manifests as "phubbing" or irritability in physical spaces, as the individual becomes more tethered to the urgent, digital simulation of crisis than to the nuanced, quiet reality of the people sitting directly across from them.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
