239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (    To mitigate these corrosive effects, it is essential to transition from passive consumption to intentional digital boundaries by implementing "friction" into the scrolling experience. One effective approach involves setting a physical timer or utilizing greyscale display settings to strip the interface of its neurological rewards, thereby breaking the trance-like state of the infinite scroll. Furthermore, rebalancing one's digital diet by consciously seeking out solution-oriented or local community content can help restore a sense of agency that global news often strips away. Ultimately, by reclaiming our attention from the algorithm, we can move away from a state of paralyzed observation and return to a life defined by active, meaningful engagement with the physical world.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
