/Title (The findings appeared in the Journal of Social and Clinical Psychology. With just ten weeks passing, changes were already clear. Since connection often happens face-to-face, digital distance helped some feel closer. As screen habits shifted, inner states followed. Even so, results varied slightly across individuals. After all, everyone uses platforms differently. Yet overall, stepping away brought relief.[2])
